.*
.* QUIENVVAR: WRKENVVAR at either level. The driver gives each entry's
.* name and quoted value cut to their columns, with the IBM-style ">"
.* when cut (work/qsjob/src/qsh/env.rs); the first entry is the blank
.* row option 1 adds from.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 26'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 42'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=EVNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=EVVALUE CLASS=VALCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=VARS VARS='OPT EVNAME EVVALUE'.
:KEYL NAME=ENVKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display CCSIDs
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Print list
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION='RETURN 18'.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=F22 ACTION='RETURN 22'.F22=Display entire field
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKENVJOB KEYL=ENVKEYS HELP=ENVH ENTER='RETURN 0'.Work with Environment Vars (*JOB)
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=VARS SCROLL=YES.(No environment variables)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 101'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 102'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 104'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display details
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 106'.6=Print
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=EVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Name
:LISTCOL VAR=EVVALUE USAGE=OUTPUT.Value
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKENVSYS KEYL=ENVKEYS HELP=ENVH ENTER='RETURN 0'.Work with Environment Vars (*SYS)
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=VARS SCROLL=YES.(No environment variables)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 101'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 102'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 104'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display details
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 106'.6=Print
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=EVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Name
:LISTCOL VAR=EVVALUE USAGE=OUTPUT.Value
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=ENVH.Work with Environment Variables - Help
:P.Each line is one environment variable of the job (*JOB) or of the system (*SYS). A job starts with a copy of the system's variables; changing the job's leaves the system's as they are.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F11 shows the CCSID each value is tagged with. F22 shows a whole name and value. F16 prints the list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
